@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered : Initial State
Unregistered --> Registered : User enters details for registration
Registered --> Logged In : Login details are correct
Logged In --> Document Upload : User initiates document upload
Document Upload --> Certificate Application : User applies for certificate after uploading documents
Certificate Application --> Session Ended : User completes application or logs out
Logged In --> Session Ended : User chooses to end session

Unregistered --> Session Ended : If user chooses not to register

state "Session Ended" as sesseion_ended
sesseion_ended --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
